The '''Spirit Mask''' is an {{Epic}} Dungeon [[Helmet]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Dungeon Reward Chests ===
The '''Spirit Mask''' can be found in [[Dungeon Reward Chest]]s in [[Master Mode Floor 4|Master Mode - Floor IV]].
