When the user takes fatal damage while wearing the '''Spirit Mask''', they will be protected from that damage and all other damage for {{Green|3}} seconds. In addition, they will gain {{Stat|Spd|+50}} for {{Green|3}} seconds. The ability has a cooldown of {{Green|30s}}.

== Upgrading ==
A '''Spirit Mask''' can be upgraded into '''{{Fragged}} Spirit Mask''' using {{Item|Thorn Fragment|amount=8}}s to buff its stats, granting:
* {{Stat|def|+25}}
* {{Stat|int|+5}}
* {{Stat|spd|+15}}
* Upon proccing {{AN|Second Wind}}, heals the wearer for {{Green|10%}} of their {{Stat|hp}} over {{Green|5s}}
