== Trivia ==
*The texture used for the '''Spirit Mask''' resembles [https://wiki.leagueoflegends.com/en-us/Kindred Kindred] from the game League of Legends. 
**There is also an [[Admin-only]] helmet called the {{Item|Kindred}}, which gives {{Stat|spd|+70}}.
**The ability also seems to have a portion of Kindred's ultimate ability, which prevents users from dying. However, unlike the ability in League of Legends, '''Spirit Mask''' doesn't heal the player when the effect resolves unless it is upgraded.
*While in the Catacombs, the helmet's cooldown is also reduced by the Mage class' {{AN|Efficient Spells}} perk.
*The '''Spirit Mask''' pairs well with the {{Item|Bonzo's Mask}}, {{Item|Phoenix Pet}}, and the {{Item|Mithril Coat}}, as the anti-death abilities of all these items can be used with each other.
*The '''Spirit Mask''' cannot save players from certain deaths, such as being digested by {{MobSprite|The Matriarch}} or [[Cold|freezing to death]] in [[Glacite Mineshafts]].
*The '''Spirit Mask''' is one of two items other than [[Master Star]]s and [[Master Skulls]] that are exclusive to Master Mode, the other being the {{Item|Dark Claymore}}.
*The '''Spirit Mask''' used to be able to be bought at item rounds in a [[Dark Auction]] at a starting price of {{c|20m}}.

